{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2024-11-05","capabilities":{"tools":{}},"serverInfo":{"name":"soterai-guard","version":"1.0.0"},"instructions":"SoterAI checks text, shell commands and dependencies for security risks before you act on them. ADVISORY. SoterAI evaluated the text you submitted and returned a verdict. It did not and cannot block the action: nothing forces an agent to call this tool, and VS Code exposes no API to intercept an agent's own file, network or terminal access."}}
